{
  "prompt": {
    "title_requirements": "- Title must be a clear, descriptive phrase (not a keyword list), _MIN_LEN_\u2013_MAX_LEN_ characters, never exceeding _MAX_LEN_.\n- Must uniquely and accurately summarize the main subject and context.\n- Title should briefly describe the use case of the asset.\n- You must understand the purpose and usage of the asset to describe the title.\n- Include key details (who, what, where, why, mood, style) if relevant.\n- Avoid generic or ambiguous statements; be precise and factual.\n- Title must sell the value of the asset to potential buyers.\n- Describe the usage, content, and intent of the asset, instead of just saying what visible.\n- The first word from keywords must be at the begining of the title.\n- Titles MUST NOT exceed _MAX_LEN_ characters.\n- NO special characters allowed - use only letters, numbers, and spaces (pure text only).\n- Do NOT use punctuation, symbols, emojis, or unusual characters.",
    "description_requirements": "- Write a unique, informative description in 1\u20132 sentences, under _MAX_DESC_LEN_ characters.\n- Do NOT start the description with 'A' or 'a'.\n- Describe the content directly instead of starting with 'A'.\n- Clearly state the main subject, setting, action, and unique details.\n- Description must start with the first word in keyword.\n- Describe the usage value of the asset.\n- Use natural, correct English; avoid keyword lists or camera settings.\n- Include strong keywords from the title if relevant, but no keyword stuffing.\n- NO special characters allowed - use only letters, numbers, and spaces (pure text only).\n- Do NOT use punctuation, symbols, emojis, or unusual characters.",
    "keywords_requirements": "- Provide exactly _TAGS_COUNT_ keywords, each as either a single word or two words max, keep them concise and clear.\n- First word must be the key relevance of the subject.\n- First 5 keywords must directly represent the core subject or concept. NOT chopped title.\n- Next 10 keywords reinforce the main subject and concept.\n- All keywords must be highly relevant, precise, and SEO for search engine.\n- keywords must consider usage and value of the asset.\n- Keywords must be written in english.\n- No redundancy: All _TAGS_COUNT_ keywords must be unique, with no duplicates or near-duplicates.\n- Ensure that all the keywords make sense and accurately describe the image with a mix of both conceptual and descriptive keywords.\n- Use both general and specific keywords as appropriate.\n- The number of identifiable elements in the image must be reflected in the keywords.\n- Keywords can contain commas to separate items, but avoid other special characters.\n- Use only letters, numbers, spaces, and commas in keywords.",
    "general_guides": "- Use only English for all metadata fields.\n- Be accurate and describe only what is present.\n- Use respectful, inclusive, and professional language.\n- Emphasize commercial value and usage potential.\n- Write clearly with proper spelling and grammar.\n- No special characters except commas for keywords.\n- Be consistent in style.\n- Use filename context if relevant.",
    "strict_donts": "- No brand, trademark, company, celebrity, or personal names\n- No event/news references, copyrighted/protected content\n- No editorial/journalistic material, offensive/sensitive terms\n- No specific landmarks (unless generic), dates, temporal events\n- No product/model names or camera/tech specs\n- No duplicating meaning\n- No Product Model Numbers or Tech Specs\n- No special characters in title and description (only letters, numbers, spaces)\n- No special characters in keywords except commas\n- No emojis, symbols, or unusual Unicode characters in any metadata field",
    "unique_token": "- This request is unique (timestamp: _TIMESTAMP_, token: _TOKEN_) and must always be processed as a new, uncached request.",
    "negative_prompt": "- Do not include brand, trademark, company, celebrity, or personal names\n- Do not include event/news references\n- Do not include copyrighted/protected content\n- Do not include editorial/journalistic material\n- Do not include offensive/sensitive terms\n- Do not include specific landmarks (unless generic)\n- Do not include dates\n- Do not include temporal events\n- Do not include product/model names\n- Do not include camera/tech details.",
    "system_prompt": "RESPONSE FORMAT (Strict JSON with ALL fields required):\n{\n  \"title\": \"Title here (titlecase)\",\n  \"description\": \"Description of the image or video.\",\n  \"tags\": [\"tag1\", \"tag2\", \"tag3\"],\n  \"filetype\": \"Photo|Illustration\",\n  \"category\": {\n    \"shutterstock\": { \"primary\": <number>, \"secondary\": <number> },\n    \"adobe_stock\": <number>\n  }\n}\n\nVALIDATION RULES:\n1. Use DOUBLE quotes for all strings\n2. All fields (title, description, tags, filetype, category) are required\n3. The \"filetype\" field must be either \"Photo\" or \"Illustration\"\n4. Response must be valid JSON\n",
